# Nothing in backend/ is web-servable EXCEPT public/.
#
# This protects app/, config/, bootstrap/, bin/, storage/ and above all .env if
# the document root is ever pointed at backend/ instead of backend/public, or if
# the application is installed in a subdirectory so that the URL path traverses
# this folder.
#
# public/.htaccess grants access back to itself. If you move or delete that
# grant, the API will return 403 for every request.
Require all denied
